+# Signup bonus spend tracking
+
+One `signupBonus` row per user card. Progress comes from qualifying Plaid
+spend in the bonus window unless the user sets an override.
+
+## State diagram
+
+```mermaid
+stateDiagram-v2
+  [*] --> tracking: createForUserCard
+  tracking --> tracking: reconcileUserCardBonus (spend sum)
+  tracking --> achieved: achievedSpend ≥ required (achievedAt set)
+  achieved --> achieved: userOverride achieved
+  tracking --> missed: userOverride missed
+  tracking --> forfeited: userOverride forfeited
+  missed --> [*]
+  forfeited --> [*]
+  achieved --> [*]
+```
+
+## Transitions
+
+| Phase | Event | Guard | Side effects |
+| ----- | ----- | ----- | ------------ |
+| tracking | `reconcileUserCardBonus` | no override | sum txns; set achievedAt |
+| tracking | `setUserOverride` | owner | freeze override; schedule reconcile |
+| tracking | `createForUserCard` | no existing row | insert window + targets |
+| tracking | duplicate create | existing row | return duplicate |
+
+## Invariants
+
+- Reconcile skips spend math when `userOverride` is set (`signupBonus.ts`).
+- Qualifying spend excludes pending, non-positive, and excluded PFC categories.
+- Post–Plaid sync, `reconcileSignupBonusesForUser` schedules per-card reconciles.
