+// P27 / SRW-1422: the Bot 2 target ladder and break-even. The rung list is
+// frozen in lane_config at entry, a rung fires on a fresh bid at its price, the
+// ladder advances only on a completed allocation, and break-even is written
+// only after target one's allocation completes. Every rung sell goes through
+// the existing trim reducer, so a signal trim, a rung and a full exit never
+// work beside each other. The capability is off unless trading.target_ladder is
+// true, so the single target is proved unchanged.
+//
+// Every scenario drives createTradeMachine().tick() against a credential-free
+// fake broker. The machine decides every order; the proof only reads what was
